# Repo-root .dockerignore — orchestrator/Dockerfile and backend/Dockerfile
# both build from the repo root now (needed to reach the shared
# packages/answer-grammar workspace package), so this keeps every other
# top-level directory and dev artifact out of both build contexts.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.git
.worktrees
.claude/worktrees
frontend
docs
npm-debug.log*
*.md
.env*
!.env.sample
